1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,140
For the next two weeks, the
office becomes a survival game.

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:08,591
Food is scarce, everyone is hungry,
and anyone could turn on you.

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,667
The game runs for ten workdays.

4
00:00:11,717 --> 00:00:14,957
Your goal: stay alive,
and on the last night,

5
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:18,467
grab one of five seats
on the rescue helicopter.

6
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:21,778
Everyone starts with seven rations.

7
00:00:21,828 --> 00:00:23,548
Every night, you eat one.

8
00:00:23,598 --> 00:00:27,300
Run out, and you become a
bandit. More on that later.

9
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:32,513
Each day, you pick one secret
move in Discord before midnight.

10
00:00:32,563 --> 00:00:35,004
Nobody else can see what you chose.

11
00:00:35,054 --> 00:00:36,569
You have five options.

12
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:42,177
Scavenge. Go looking for food and
find nothing, one or two rations.

13
00:00:42,227 --> 00:00:45,741
If you forget to play, you
scavenge automatically.

14
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:49,830
Steal. Pick someone and take
up to two of their rations.

15
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,614
They'll know they were robbed.

16
00:00:51,664 --> 00:00:53,220
They won't know it was you.

17
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:57,338
Guard. You're protected
tonight and tomorrow night.

18
00:00:57,388 --> 00:01:01,201
Anyone who tries to rob you
gets caught, named in the news,

19
00:01:01,251 --> 00:01:03,230
and pays you up to two rations.

20
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,437
You only get three guards,
so choose your moment.

21
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:11,832
Investigate. Spy on one person and
find out what they did that night.

22
00:01:11,882 --> 00:01:17,269
Catch them stealing, and they're exposed
and pay you one ration, if they have it.

23
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:21,256
Gift. Give some of your
food to someone else.

24
00:01:21,306 --> 00:01:24,692
Nobody is told, unless
someone was spying on you.

25
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:30,427
Every morning at half past seven, the
news drops in Discord: who got robbed,

26
00:01:30,477 --> 00:01:33,021
who got caught, and who ran out of food.

27
00:01:33,071 --> 00:01:35,160
You'll always know what happened.

28
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,105
You'll rarely know who did it.

29
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:41,919
Run out of food and you're
a bandit. Bandits don't eat.

30
00:01:41,969 --> 00:01:46,084
They can only steal one ration
at a time, or investigate.

31
00:01:46,134 --> 00:01:50,103
Get back to three rations
and you rejoin the survivors.

32
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:54,999
You'll also get a secret goal
that only you know about.

33
00:01:55,049 --> 00:02:00,217
And once a day you can post an
anonymous message on the radio channel.

34
00:02:00,267 --> 00:02:02,825
Tips, accusations, lies. Your call.

35
00:02:03,650 --> 00:02:06,441
On the last night, the helicopter lands.

36
00:02:06,491 --> 00:02:09,921
The five survivors with
the most food get a seat.

37
00:02:09,971 --> 00:02:15,320
Staying alive earns points, a seat earns
more, and so does your secret goal.

38
00:02:15,370 --> 00:02:16,527
Most points wins.

39
00:02:16,577 --> 00:02:21,712
Then comes the big reveal: every theft
and every secret, out in the open.

40
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:26,226
It takes two minutes a day,
it's completely optional,

41
00:02:26,276 --> 00:02:30,163
and nothing in the game touches
real work or real money.

42
00:02:30,213 --> 00:02:36,068
Type slash join in Discord and you'll get
a secret alias, so nobody knows who's who.

43
00:02:36,118 --> 00:02:37,967
And remember: trust no one.
